<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-BBL CUTS BANK SAVINGS CERTS RATES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BBL CUTS BANK SAVINGS CERTS RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles</p>
<p>Lambert said on Tuesday it would cut interest rates on its bank</p>
<p>savings certificates from July 16. BBL's move is in line with</p>
<p>other banks:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    one year	  3.00 pct	3.00</p>
<p>    three years     3.65 pct	3.75</p>
<p>    five years	4.35 pct	4.50</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
